  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Prehistoric_Paintings/MP_PrehistoricPaintings_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">现在，原本方方正正的普通画作将被全新的史前风格画作所取代！这是为那些设定在过去、拥有恐龙的游戏准备的理想模组。包含景观、恐龙、恐龙战斗等更多精彩内容！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>你需要一个服务器来与朋友一起游玩吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Prehistoric_Paintings/MP_PrehistoricPaintings_promo.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"213\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果你正在寻找一个可以与朋友一起玩任何模组或整合包的服务器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a></span> 是你的最佳解决方案！他们提供性价比最高的 Minecraft 服务器，并且如果你点击<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">这个链接</a></strong></span>，使用代码 \"Lupin\" 即可获得 25% 的折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Prehistoric_Paintings/MP_PrehistoricPaintings_description.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">一旦安装此模组，所有原版画作都将被替换为全新的……现在它们都将变成新颖独特的画作，描绘着不同的史前场景……</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">1.20.4 或更早版本将添加 26 幅新画作，而 1.21.1 版本将总共添加 46 幅新画作。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Prehistoric_Paintings/MP_PrehistoricPaintings_faq.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>为了让模组生效，我必须安装资源包吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不，当然不需要！你不需要任何其他模组或资源包。你只需要下载此模组即可——书籍的外观将会改变！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它在服务器上也能运行吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然可以！它运行完美！请记住，使用模组和朋友一起游玩的最佳方式是 BisectHosting，通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>点击此链接可获得 25% 的折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个资源包可以用于整合包中吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！只要它仅发布在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上即可。将其上传到其他任何平台都将违反我们的权利，是完全不允许的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果你考虑将其添加到你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我们将不胜感激。如果你需要任何小改动或有任何疑问，请联系我们！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以录制关于此模组的视频并在我的频道展示吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以，你可以自由在你的频道上游玩此模组或我们的任何整合包并制作相关视频，事实上，我们会对此非常感激！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Prehistoric_Paintings/MP_PrehistoricPaintings_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"140\"></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1127/852/prehistoric-paintings-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1127/856/prehistoric-paintings-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1127/857/prehistoric-paintings-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1127/858/prehistoric-paintings-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1127/859/prehistoric-paintings-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1127/860/prehistoric-paintings-9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></span></p>",
